ur artwork and poses. If you don't mind, I would like to request an illustration of two characters.\n\n🐦XY (bird) is a playful seamstress, has wings and a beauty mark under one eye. 🦄 ZH (qilin) is a cold and elegant heiress who is also a powerful wizard. They live in a fantasy chinese setting, set in snow. I would like to see them in 🦄's library. Perhaps 🦄 can be reading to 🐦, or helping her pick a book off a high shelf?\n\nI will leave the pose and composition up to you! There are images in the folder you can use as inspiration, or you can draw freely! 🥰 If there are any problems, you can decline the request.\n\nThank you for considering..! 💞\n\nhttps://sta.sh/22dgc62amxqi", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@shiroicbe/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1482366, "client_id": 1338505, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b1a8d13b/uploads/origins/114fcc86-c7aa-40a3-8831-339db282d947?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=31c343608f7f647262ae74a4783c0ccf", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b1a8d13b/uploads/origins/114fcc86-c7aa-40a3-8831-339db282d947?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=31c343608f7f647262ae74a4783c0ccf, https://si.imgix.net/b1a8d13b/uploads/origins/114fcc86-c7aa-40a3-8831-339db282d947?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=228ee20278f6ba4028c281df2f54932f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b1a8d13b/uploads/origins/114fcc86-c7aa-40a3-8831-339db282d947?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=385935c241200a735fdd2e8c012fd375 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b1a8d13b/uploads/origins/114fcc86-c7aa-40a3-8831-339db282d947?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=we